---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import H1 from '../../components/H1.astro';
import H2 from '../../components/H2.astro';
import Main from '../../components/Main.astro';
import Table from '../../components/ui/Table.astro';
import WorksImg from '../../components/ui/WorksImg.astro';
import BtnBack from '../../components/ui/BtnBack.astro'
---

<Layout title="制作実績:ポートフォリオ２ | cascade-path">
	<Header />
	<H1>制作実績:「ポートフォリオ２」</H1>
    <Main>
        <WorksImg SRC="https://portfolio.cascade-path.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/058b5f8f2d275e8fa5152f5cfe389b7a-edited.jpeg" />
        <Table rows={[
            { left: "公開日", right: "2026年4月" },
            { left: "規模", right: "9ページ" },
            { left: "技術", right: "PHP/HTML/CSS/JS" },
            { left: "制作期間", right: "2週間" },
            { left: "制作環境", right: "WordPress/VS Code" },
            { left: "公開リンク", right: "https://portfolio.cascade-path.com" },
        ]} />
        <div>WordPressを用いて作った旧ポートフォリオです。</div>
        <div>テーマ編集、FTP、レンタルサーバ設定まで行いました。</div>
        <H2>制作過程</H2>
        <h3>WordPressテーマ編集</h3>
        <WorksImg SRC="https://portfolio.cascade-path.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/7725d3e038d01765b410d86984d928c5-edited.png" />
        <WorksImg SRC="https://portfolio.cascade-path.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/da5d94a96f86251808b391e5c3e744fd-edited.png" />
        <h3>WordPress</h3>
        <WorksImg SRC="https://portfolio.cascade-path.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/7fe3b14711b7399da8afae82e943cd53-2048x1432.png" />
        <h2>まとめ</h2>
        <BtnBack HREF="/works">一覧に戻る</BtnBack>
    </Main>
    <Footer />
</Layout>
